  "title": "Slow Cooker Roast Beef in its own Gravy",
  "description": "Slow cooker roast beef served with potatoes and carrots is topped with rich gravy made from reduced cream of celery soup in the slow cooker.",
  "authors": [
    "Heather Dunn"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:03:28-04:00",
